Her rationality guides him.

944
00:36:13,133 --> 00:36:14,567
So he's very balanced.

945
00:36:15,200 --> 00:36:17,100
You need to express yourself in various ways.

946
00:36:17,100 --> 00:36:18,100
Body language.

947
00:36:18,100 --> 00:36:19,000
Eye contact.

948
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:19,233
Yes.

949
00:36:19,233 --> 00:36:21,567
Including these small interactions.

950
00:36:21,567 --> 00:36:24,300
