This one.

1105
00:42:47,800 --> 00:42:48,400
Just this.

1106
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:53,233
Okay, then I'll just keep screaming all the way.

1107
00:42:57,067 --> 00:42:57,633
Just like that.

1108
00:43:00,533 --> 00:43:01,433
Go ahead.

1109
00:43:01,433 --> 00:43:02,567
This angle.

1110
00:43:04,533 --> 00:43:05,033
Okay.

1111
00:43:05,033 --> 00:43:05,767
Slightly bend your knees.

1112
00:43:05,767 --> 00:43:06,100
Okay.

1113
00:43:06,100 --> 00:43:07,300
Can you lean back?

1114
