Yes, I can.

1115
00:43:07,767 --> 00:43:09,633
Don't stare, and don't jump this step.

1116
00:43:09,633 --> 00:43:10,167
Okay.

1117
00:43:11,233 --> 00:43:13,000
Come to the center.

1118
00:43:13,000 --> 00:43:13,567
A bit slower.

1119
00:43:14,767 --> 00:43:16,167
Step back a little more.

1120
00:43:17,033 --> 00:43:17,767
A little more.

1121
00:43:18,667 --> 00:43:19,767
Okay, this is good.

1122
00:43:20,433 --> 00:43:21,000
That's fine.

1123
00:43:21,333 --> 00:43:22,167
