1124
00:43:22,500 --> 00:43:23,800
Ready.

1125
00:43:23,800 --> 00:43:24,733
Okay, lower your head.

1126
00:43:24,733 --> 00:43:26,133
Don't look anymore.

1127
00:43:26,133 --> 00:43:27,133
