1128
00:43:27,767 --> 00:43:29,767
Three, two, one, that's it.

1129
00:43:31,667 --> 00:43:32,633
That's it.

1130
00:43:34,533 --> 00:43:35,533
That's it.

1131
00:43:39,633 --> 00:43:42,333
This time, I invited Liang Tian out to have fun.

1132
00:43:42,333 --> 00:43:43,633
